ty to play, changing your max health (easy Mode makes platforming slightly easier)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A built-in Speedrun Mode which adds a timer for speedrunning</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Infinity Mode where you play through infinite procedurally-generated levels until you fail one</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>30 achievements</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The credits are a minigame rather than just boring scrolling text</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOTE: I check Discord much more often than email, so if possible, please use the Creative Coded Games Discord server for questions, bug reports, etc...</p>","developers":["Creative Coded Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940920/7a1175bf35f60aeb3f27d791cb8af69e28da4d4b/header.jpg?t=1759278235","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.13 High Sierra<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 (or equivalent)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 4000 / AMD Radeon R7 / NVIDIA GeForce GT 640M or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3940920/1994648618/ce99bcdb3c9856006065c9577612e3c849ce958b/1759277425/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759278231","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3940920/1994648618/ce99bcdb3c9856006065c9577612e3c849ce958b/1759277425/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759278231","highlight":false,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3940920/1994648618/ce99bc